{"duration_ms":0,"id":46,"kind":"llm","model":"claude-opus-5","name":"claude-code.turn.30","provider":"anthropic","response":{"content":[{"text":"Fixed and verified.\n\n## What was wrong\n\n`stats.py:3` computed the mean with floor division:\n\n```python\nreturn sum(values) // len(values)   # was\nreturn sum(values) / len(values)    # now\n```\n\nThe dashboard's samples are sub-1 in the unit being summed, so `sum // len` floored every result to `0` — and it renders as `0 ms`. The cause was in `stats.mean`, not in `dashboard.average_response_ms`, so that's where the one-character fix went; guarding the dashboard call site would have left the same bad return value for the next caller.\n\nThe docstring already promised \"arithmetic mean,\" so the code was contradicting its own contract rather than implementing a deliberate integer-mean policy.\n\n## Verification\n\nNo tests existed anywhere in the repo and there was no runner config, so I wrote `test_stats.py`. Before the edit, all 3 failed for the expected reason — `average_response_ms([0.4, 0.8, 0.6])` returned `0.0`, reproducing the reported symptom exactly. After the edit, all 3 pass. That file is the entire suite, so the full suite is green.\n\n## One thing to flag\n\n`mean` has a second caller: `billing.average_invoice`. The fix necessarily changes it too — `average_invoice([10, 15])` now returns `12.5` where it previously returned `12`. I believe that's correct (it was silently under-reporting invoice averages the same way, and \"average invoice value in currency units\" should carry a fractional part), and I covered it with a test. But it's a behavior change outside the bug you reported, so it's worth your sign-off.\n\nNothing in this repo calls `average_invoice` — I grepped. If a consumer lives outside this repo and expects an `int` (say, it treats the value as whole cents), tell me and I'll either give `billing` its own explicitly-floored wrapper or have it round at the call site, keeping `mean` honest either way.","type":"text"}],"id":"msg_011Ceu9aboixUFykZozRvSiJ","model":"claude-opus-5","role":"assistant","stop_reason":null,"usage":{"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":152,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"cache_creation_input_tokens":152,"cache_read_input_tokens":25060,"inference_geo":"not_available","input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":2,"service_tier":"standard"}},"start_ms":0,"usage":{"cache_read":25060,"cache_write_1h":152,"input":2,"output":2}}
